      "text": "❗️ Last night, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continued delivering strikes by unmanned aerial vehicles against port infrastructure facilities, as well as ships used to support the AFU. As a result of the strike, the following targets were hit: ▪️ in the port of Izmail, port infrastructure facilities used for unloading and storing military cargo intended to support the AFU; ▪️ at sea, a dry cargo ship delivering dual-use cargo for the AFU to the port of Yuzhny. 🔹 Russian Defence Ministry",
